{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法依農業發展條例第十八條第六項規定訂定之。","id":"M0110010/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"6e99b9125a6ccc55382efcc7bb1542d4acd7916f3aca2c0a669e042666c20949","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"M0110010/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":23,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"依農業用地興建農舍辦法集村興建農舍，得申請本辦法之獎勵及協助。","id":"M0110010/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"796821116a6e80b88e56349471edaa32e6a5c1ff0ff289718cf5dd9a0e8b1815","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"M0110010/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":31,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"同一集村興建農舍地區之起造人，其集村興建農舍坐落之農業用地符合下列各款規定之一者，得於取得農舍使用執照一年內，填具申請書並檢附農舍使用執照影本及照片各一份，向直轄市、縣（市）主管機關申請獎勵；經直轄市、縣（市）主管機關實地訪查符合者，發給獎狀：\n一、設置寬度達十公尺以上之隔離綠帶。\n二、設置生態污水處理設施。","id":"M0110010/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"d5e2fa96ab1d1881c3359fc6444b70e45bdf4a212e962729a942447ec72bb194","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"M0110010/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":155,"children":[{"id":"M0110010/a:3/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":123,"end":142,"children":[]},{"id":"M0110010/a:3/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":142,"end":155,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"直轄市、縣（市）主管機關得邀集相關機關（單位）及專家學者組成服務小組，協助農民集村興建農舍。","id":"M0110010/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"cd344a769b8d14a6cde48beea968080abe18d5aae6cac99ddbedcebc146f81d4","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"M0110010/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":46,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法自發布日施行。","id":"M0110010/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"47b8a3e12a88555780e2c610257366d820f6c2f5ed79aaf37d74ac3e56199b62","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"M0110010/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[],"category":"農業與山坡地","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國九十年九月二十八日行政院農業委員會（90）農水保字第 901\n  856207  號令訂定發布全文 9  條\n2.中華民國九十九年十一月十七日行政院農業委員會農水保字第 0991875\n  954 號令修正發布全文 5  條；並自發布日施行","id":"M0110010","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2010-11-17","name":"集村興建農舍獎勵及協助辦法","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=M0110010","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"8fb1d094c2fe7eda6ea5643608d288aa24d8d7d01f4c8c8574654d9a3748baf4","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2010-11-17","effectiveDate":""}}